  "description": "I woke up from a game I was playing to raise my daughter. To make matters worse, I've lost the \"player\" who could have saved her. I can't log out, and all I have is a pile of debt and a heroine to raise. To get out of the game, I must raise my nephew well and see the ending. Then, a mysterious figure appears and hands her a mysterious proposal of marriage...\n\nEden Bertenon, the Grand Duke, who was only mentioned in the game, has asked me to marry him. A man who proposes to a woman he's never met before without even blinking an eye. I don't know why or how, but he might be a clue to the hidden ending.\n\nA contract marriage with a promise of divorce at the same time as the proposal. Now that I have a reasonable husband, I thought all that was left was to raise the heroine safely and see the ending....\n\n*Note: This is a promotional oneshot.*\n\nPromotional Oneshot\n\n***Artist(s):**  \nCover Artist: Cocorip   \nPromo Artist: Yooani*",
